WEBVTT

NOTE Narration is displayed in the caption strip below the video by default.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.302
Review effort should rise with the consequences.

00:00:03.302 --> 00:00:06.605
Fictional practice notes may be checked directly.

00:00:06.605 --> 00:00:09.907
An inaccurate customer message needs source verification.

00:00:09.907 --> 00:00:16.040
A request involving private information or binding commitments requires permission and human authority.

00:00:16.040 --> 00:00:19.342
If those are absent, stop and escalate.

00:00:19.342 --> 00:00:23.588
A more polished answer does not remove the risk.
